      omega
    · rw [vEq]; exact topF_clean j0 (by decide) (by decide) d x p raw cut dom n0 tape _ _ _ cut0 _ (by simp only [Shadow7.e0P]; (try simp only [Wire] at *); omega)
    · rw [vEq]
