section

/-!
# 20-Tick Shadow Window Body, Reference Overlay, and Native Block Heads

1. **`WideReference20`**: generalized `origin20` / `endRaw20` / `Box20` / `advance20` / `stepInput20`
   supporting both 20-tick blocks (`curLen = 20`, `prevLen ∈ {15, 20}`) and the 15-tick re-entry block
   at tick `345` (`curLen = 15`, `prevLen = 20`).
2. **20-Tick Window Body**: `body20`, `unbody20`, `watch20`, `MayTouch20`, `firstUnchanged20`,
   `PastFacts20`, `RowTruth20`, and `row_truth20_chronology`.
3. **`NativeJ20`**: window head semantics for all 9 twenty-tick blocks (`j : Fin 9`, `s = 165..325`),
   including `next_window20`, `saved_with_pending20`, `real_receipt20`, `cleared_holes20`,
   `tail_clean20`, `top_clean20`, `parked_clean20`, `upper_clear20`, `scratch_raw_clean20`, and
   `agree_origin20`.
4. **`Reentry345`**: window head semantics for the `s = 345` re-entry block (`j20`), bridging from
   20-tick block `8` (`s = 325`) back into standard 15-tick `CRTBarrel.leave j20`.
-/

